+## Implementation status (CLI side, 2026-06-09)
+
+| Criterion | Status |
+|---|---|
+| 1. Daemon-routed inject writes ledger-only, ZERO send-keys, `delivery_path:"daemon"` | DONE — `daemon_registered_session_injects_ledger_only_zero_send_keys` (tmux-bin spy) |
